"""PebbleOS developer CLI.

Drives the CMake firmware build (configure, build, bundle, menuconfig) and
hosts the operational commands that are not build steps: flash, qemu,
console, debug, screenshot, openocd, reset, bork, image_*, make_lang,
pack_lang, pack_all_langs. The unit tests are their own CMake project,
built and run by ``./pbl test``, and the shippable SDK is the firmware
build's ``sdk`` target (``./pbl build sdk``).

Build state is read from the configured build directory
(``build/pbl_env.json``). Run ``./pbl configure --board BOARD`` first.
"""

